<title>USA: Glorious Sun buys NYC office for $47 mln.</title>
<headline>Glorious Sun buys NYC office for $47 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glorious Sun Enterprises Ltd has purchased an office building located on New York City's Park Avenue, for $47 million, a real estate broker said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The broker, James Lang Wootton International USA, said the sale of the 200,000 square-foot building, located at 505 Park Avenue in Manhattan, was made on behalf of a private client, whose identity was not disclosed.</p>
<p>Glorious Sun is a Hong Kong apparel manufacturer and real estate investor.</p>
</text>
